# AppLauncher - futuristic application launcher (Super + Space)
#   ✔ Every installed app (.desktop), grouped by category
#   ✔ Ranked instant search (name > words > keywords > fuzzy)
#   ✔ Keyboard first: type, arrows, Enter · Esc closes
#   ✔ "Frequent" category learns what you open
#   ✔ Right click an app to pin / unpin it in the Dock
#   ✔ Session buttons (lock, logout, reboot, power off) with confirm
#   ✔ No match? Enter searches the web
